▶ real Agenda concurrency
✓ Agenda real concurrency passed: two concurrent users, exactly one BOOKED.
✓ Quota real concurrency passed: one Student, two distinct sessions, limit=1, exactly one BOOKED.
✓ Real retry/cancellation concurrency passed: stable UUID and at most one consumed unit.
✓ Teacher cancellation versus attendance/booking races passed: unique attendance, cancelled sessions and zero active consumption.
✓ Concurrent session creation: one winner, overlapping request rejected, extra ADMIN role does not expand scope.
✓ Session edit × booking: booking snapshot always matches the committed session structure.
✓ Availability delete × session creation: serialized result never violates availability.
✓ Real review concurrency: identical requests share one review; conflicting feedback has one winner.
✓ Real webhook concurrency: one durable processed event and READY projection.
PASS Placement real concurrency: two eligible Students, last seat, one winner; loser rolled back; identical review/choice retries stable; occupancy=1.
PASS: two overlapping service workers, 2 + 2 disjoint deliveries, one attempt per row.
PASS Billing webhook concurrency: webhook vs checkout completion ends ACTIVE without loss; unlinked checkout retries without a stored event and the same event is reprocessed; CONFIRMED/RECEIVED apply once with one notification.
PASS Course completion real concurrency: two final lessons in parallel, no deadlock, exactly one COMPLETED and one audit row; progress after completion still allowed.

✓ integration SQL suite passed (35 file(s)).

